) -> std::ffi::c::Int}} {no {{variadic {a variadic function (...) with no fixed parameter}}}}}

test cb-fixture-variadic-prototype-probe {the C compiler confirms every variadic prototype the generator binds: its type of the function is the parsed one, fixed parameters then `...`; a prototype the parser read wrong -- a va_list taken for `...`, a `...` lost, another fixed parameter -- is no binding (prototype-mismatch)} -constraints clang -body {
