} -result {{unsupported {} prototype-mismatch {the compiler's type of bgf_printf is not the variadic prototype the header parser read: planted: the compiler's type differs}} {direct bgf::bgf direct} 0 {no {{unsupported-callback-signature {a variadic callback (int (int n, ...))}}}}}

