test cb-fixture-targets {generation is target-aware: the target's preprocessing decides which declarations exist (Linux-only, Apple-only, AArch64-only, an x86-64 calling convention) and the target's typedef chains their C types (uint64_t is unsigned long on LP64 Linux, unsigned long long on Apple), the target's plain char a constant's value ((char)200 is -56 where char is signed, 200 on AArch64 Linux); a link symbol's user label prefix (Apple's _) is the target's; the manifest names the target} -constraints clang -body {
